---
import Icon from '../Icon.astro';
---

<section id="start" class="band closing" aria-labelledby="start-title">
  <h2 id="start-title">Pull it. Point it at Postgres. Define something.</h2>
  <pre><code><span class="q">$</span> docker pull ghcr.io/tachyon-cms/tachyoncms:v0.1.0</code></pre>
  <p>Or grab a binary for Linux or macOS. The docs take you from there to your first API key.</p>
  <div class="actions">
    <a class="btn" href="https://docs.tachyoncms.com/install">Get started <Icon name="FiArrowRight" /></a>
    <a class="btn ghost" href="https://github.com/tachyon-cms/tachyoncms">
      <Icon name="FiGithub" /> Star on GitHub
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .closing {
    text-align: center;
  }
  h2 {
    max-width: 18ch;
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3.4rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  pre {
    display: inline-block;
    max-width: 100%;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    padding: 0.8rem 1.2rem;
    font: 0.875rem/1.5 var(--font-mono);
    text-align: left;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    background: var(--c-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--c-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
  }
  .q {
    color: var(--c-muted);
  }
  p {
    color: var(--c-muted);
  }
  .actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
</style>
